{
 "id": "seg4",
 "title": "账户层权限",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 97.16,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "前面讲的，都是合约层的权限。账户本身，也有权限。",
   "spoken": "前面讲的，都是合约层的权限。账户本身，也有权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 5.843
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "以太坊的外部账户，只有一把私钥。",
   "spoken": "以太坊的外部账户，只有一把私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-01.wav",
   "start": 6.3,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 6.396,
   "speechEnd": 8.915
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "TRON 不一样。按 TRON 官方文档和安全公司的公开资料，它的账户原生支持多重权限。",
   "spoken": "TRON 不一样。按 TRON 官方文档和安全公司的公开资料，它的账户原生支持多虫权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-02.wav",
   "start": 9.32,
   "dur": 8.0,
   "speechStart": 9.417,
   "speechEnd": 17.13
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "Owner 权限最高，能修改其他权限，包括增删签名人。",
   "spoken": "Owner 权限最高，能修改其他权限，包括增删签名人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-03.wav",
   "start": 17.54,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 17.637,
   "speechEnd": 21.838
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "Active 管日常操作，比如转账、质押、调用合约。它可以有多个，每个可以限定操作类型。",
   "spoken": "Active 管日常操作，比如转账、质押、掉用合约。它可以有多个，每个可以限定操作类型。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-04.wav",
   "start": 22.24,
   "dur": 8.72,
   "speechStart": 22.342,
   "speechEnd": 30.719
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "Witness 只管超级代表，也就是出块节点的相关操作。",
   "spoken": "Witness 只管超级代表，也就是出块节点的相关操作。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-05.wav",
   "start": 31.18,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 31.28,
   "speechEnd": 35.344
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "每个权限有一组地址，每个地址有权重。",
   "spoken": "每个权限有一组地址，每个地址有权重。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-06.wav",
   "start": 35.8,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 35.898,
   "speechEnd": 39.701
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "权重加起来达到阈值，操作才执行。",
   "spoken": "权重加起来达到阈值，操作才执行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-07.wav",
   "start": 40.1,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 40.1,
   "speechEnd": 42.927
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "这套设计，被骗子用来做多签诈骗。",
   "spoken": "这套设计，被骗子用来做多签诈骗。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-08.wav",
   "start": 43.36,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 43.457,
   "speechEnd": 46.09
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "第一步，受害者在假钱包或钓鱼页上，泄露了私钥。",
   "spoken": "第一步，受害者在假钱包或钓鱼页上，泄露了私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-09.wav",
   "start": 46.54,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 46.638,
   "speechEnd": 51.462
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "第二步，攻击者修改账户权限，把 Owner 和 Active 都改成自己。",
   "spoken": "第二步，攻击者修改账户权限，把 Owner 和 Active 都改成自己。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-10.wav",
   "start": 51.88,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 51.973,
   "speechEnd": 57.233
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "第三步，受害者还能看到余额，但已经转不出来。",
   "spoken": "第三步，受害者还能看到余额，但已经转不出来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-11.wav",
   "start": 57.7,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 57.7,
   "speechEnd": 61.857
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "转入不需要签名。新的 USDT，还会继续转进来。",
   "spoken": "转入不需要签名。新的 USDT，还会继续转进来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-12.wav",
   "start": 62.32,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 62.416,
   "speechEnd": 66.508
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "攻击者不急。账户看起来正常，他择机再全部转走。",
   "spoken": "攻击者不急。账户看起来正常，他择机再全部转走。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-13.wav",
   "start": 66.94,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 67.033,
   "speechEnd": 71.491
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "这种骗局，也常见于场外交易。",
   "spoken": "这种骗局，也常见于场外交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-14.wav",
   "start": 71.96,
   "dur": 2.72,
   "speechStart": 72.057,
   "speechEnd": 74.499
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "骗子给你一个有余额、却转不出来的账户私钥，诱导你付手续费。",
   "spoken": "骗子给你一个有余额、却转不出来的账户私钥，诱导你付手续费。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-15.wav",
   "start": 74.9,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 74.9,
   "speechEnd": 80.103
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "对合约开发者，这里有一个含义。",
   "spoken": "对合约开发者，这里有一个含义。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-16.wav",
   "start": 80.48,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 80.48,
   "speechEnd": 83.233
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "在 TRON 上，一个地址等于一把私钥，这个假设不成立。",
   "spoken": "在 TRON 上，一个地址等于一把私钥，这个假设不成立。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-17.wav",
   "start": 83.66,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 83.66,
   "speechEnd": 88.118
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "收到一个地址，不能假设它由单一私钥控制。设成 owner 之前，先查它的权限配置。",
   "spoken": "收到一个地址，不能假设它由单一私钥控制。设成 owner 之前，先查它的权限配置。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-18.wav",
   "start": 88.52,
   "dur": 7.44,
   "speechStart": 88.52,
   "speechEnd": 95.723
  }
 ],
